                    <h3 {...stylex.attrs(blogStyles.articleSubheading)}>Browser and mobile: ONNX Runtime Web</h3>
                    <p {...stylex.attrs(blogStyles.articleParagraph)}>
                        Compiling Burn straight to WASM for the browser and
                        mobile wasn't viable, so I built an export pipeline
                        instead:
                    </p>

